    "LANCE (ELITE 4) FILL -- Map 318.",
    "Phase 4 (Endgame): Final Elite Four battle before the Champion.",
    "",
    "Lance is the Dragon Master, the most powerful E4 member, and a political figure in the League.",
    "He is aware of Mewtwo rumors, the Silph Co. crisis, and the political fractures in Kanto.",
    "His dialogue is PATH-NEUTRAL (Map 318 is SPECIAL_LOGIC -- path branching handled elsewhere).",
    "His pre-battle speech is the longest and most dramatic of all four E4 members.",
    "",
