    "E3 pages 0-4: Pre-battle speech rethemed (Lance personality: commanding, reverent of power,",
    "  politically aware, dramatic). Post-battle lines rethemed (gravitas of final gate).",
    "  Pages 0-3 share identical dialogue text with different start_indices (team variants).",
    "  Page 4 (switch 850, hardmode) has different start_indices but same dialogue.",
    "  Pre-battle = 3 text blocks. Post-battle = 4 text blocks.",
    "E3 page 5: Post-defeat flavor only (1 block).",
    "",
    "Total: 38 dialogue blocks.",
