        "3": {
          "name": "EV003",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 12,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've been waiting, \\PN.",
                    "I am Lance. I stand as the",
                    "last gate before the",
                    "Champion's throne."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've watched your journey",
                    "across Kanto. The Gyms, the",
                    "roads, the choices you were",
                    "forced to make. Silph Co.",
                    "The fractures in our region",
                    "that no one wants to name."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My \\V[5]s are not simply",
                    "strong. They are ancient.",
                    "They remember a world before",
                    "Pok\u00e9 Balls and Leagues --",
                    "before humans decided what",
                    "power was allowed to exist.",
                    "True strength is not taken.",
                    "It is proven. So prove it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 24,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My dragons gave everything.",
                    "And still you stand. I have",
                    "not seen strength like yours",
                    "since your rival came through",
                    "that door."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I held this institution",
                    "together through Silph, through",
                    "Saffron, through things I",
                    "cannot name here. But there",
                    "is one more door."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 31,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Someone reached this summit",
                    "before you. \\V[12]."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "He defeated every one of us",
                    "and claimed the throne. If",
                    "you want it -- you'll have",
                    "to take it from him."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
